{"book":"hono","chapter":"api","chapterTitle":"مرجع الواجهة","slug":"routing","title":"التوجيه","headings":[{"depth":2,"id":"أساسي","text":"أساسي"},{"depth":2,"id":"معامل-المسار","text":"معامل المسار"},{"depth":2,"id":"معامل-اختياري","text":"معامل اختياري"},{"depth":2,"id":"regexp","text":"Regexp"},{"depth":2,"id":"تضمين-الشرطات-المائلة","text":"تضمين الشرطات المائلة"},{"depth":2,"id":"مسار-متسلسل","text":"مسار متسلسل"},{"depth":2,"id":"التجميع","text":"التجميع"},{"depth":2,"id":"التجميع-دون-تغيير-المسار-الأساسي","text":"التجميع دون تغيير المسار الأساسي"},{"depth":2,"id":"المسار-الأساسي","text":"المسار الأساسي"},{"depth":2,"id":"التوجيه-باستخدام-اسم-المضيف","text":"التوجيه باستخدام اسم المضيف"},{"depth":2,"id":"التوجيه-باستخدام-host-قيمة-الترويسة","text":"التوجيه باستخدام host قيمة الترويسة"},{"depth":2,"id":"أولوية-التوجيه","text":"أولوية التوجيه"},{"depth":2,"id":"ترتيب-التجميع","text":"ترتيب التجميع"}],"html":"<p>توجيه Hono مرن وبديهي.\nلنلقِ نظرة.</p>\n<h2 id=\"أساسي\">أساسي</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// HTTP Methods</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET /&#x27;</span>))\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">post</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST /&#x27;</span>))\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">put</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;PUT /&#x27;</span>))\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">delete</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;DELETE /&#x27;</span>))\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">query</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;QUERY /&#x27;</span>))\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Wildcard</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/wild/*/card&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET /wild/*/card&#x27;</span>)\n})\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Any HTTP methods</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">all</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/hello&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Any Method /hello&#x27;</span>))\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Custom HTTP method</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">on</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;PURGE&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/cache&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;PURGE Method /cache&#x27;</span>))\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Multiple Method</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">on</span>([<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;PUT&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;DELETE&#x27;</span>], <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/post&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span>\n  c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;PUT or DELETE /post&#x27;</span>)\n)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Multiple Paths</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">on</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET&#x27;</span>, [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/hello&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/ja/hello&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/en/hello&#x27;</span>], <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span>\n  c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Hello&#x27;</span>)\n)\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"معامل-المسار\">معامل المسار</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/user/:name&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> name = c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">req</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">param</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;name&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">//       ^?</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ...</span>\n})\n</code></pre>\n<p>أو جميع المعاملات دفعة واحدة:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts/:id/comment/:comment_id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { id, comment_id } = c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">req</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">param</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">//       ^?</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ...</span>\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"معامل-اختياري\">معامل اختياري</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Will match `/api/animal` and `/api/animal/:type`</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api/animal/:type?&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Animal!&#x27;</span>))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"regexp\">Regexp</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/post/:date{[0-9]+}/:title{[a-z]+}&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { date, title } = c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">req</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">param</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">//       ^?</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ...</span>\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"تضمين-الشرطات-المائلة\">تضمين الشرطات المائلة</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/posts/:filename{.+\\\\.png}&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">async</span> (c) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">//...</span>\n})\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"مسار-متسلسل\">مسار متسلسل</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\napp\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/endpoint&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;GET /endpoint&#x27;</span>)\n  })\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">post</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;POST /endpoint&#x27;</span>)\n  })\n  .<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">delete</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;DELETE /endpoint&#x27;</span>)\n  })\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"التجميع\">التجميع</h2>\n<p>يمكنك تجميع المسارات مع نسخة Hono وإضافتها إلى التطبيق الرئيسي باستخدام طريقة route.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> book = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n\nbook.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;List Books&#x27;</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// GET /book</span>\nbook.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// GET /book/:id</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> id = c.<span class=\"hljs-property\">req</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">param</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;id&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Get Book: &#x27;</span> + id)\n})\nbook.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">post</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Create Book&#x27;</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// POST /book</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">route</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/book&#x27;</span>, book)\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"التجميع-دون-تغيير-المسار-الأساسي\">التجميع دون تغيير المسار الأساسي</h2>\n<p>يمكنك أيضاً تجميع عدة نسخ (instances) مع الحفاظ على الأساس (base).</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> book = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\nbook.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/book&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;List Books&#x27;</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// GET /book</span>\nbook.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">post</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/book&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Create Book&#x27;</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// POST /book</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> user = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>().<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">basePath</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/user&#x27;</span>)\nuser.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;List Users&#x27;</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// GET /user</span>\nuser.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">post</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Create User&#x27;</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// POST /user</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">route</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, book) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Handle /book</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">route</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span>, user) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Handle /user</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"المسار-الأساسي\">المسار الأساسي</h2>\n<p>يمكنك تحديد المسار الأساسي.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> api = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>().<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">basePath</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/api&#x27;</span>)\napi.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/book&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;List Books&#x27;</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// GET /api/book</span>\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"التوجيه-باستخدام-اسم-المضيف\">التوجيه باستخدام اسم المضيف</h2>\n<p>يعمل بشكل جيد إذا تضمّن اسم مضيف.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">getPath</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">req</span>) =&gt;</span> req.<span class=\"hljs-property\">url</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">replace</span>(<span class=\"hljs-regexp\">/^https?:\\/([^?]+).*$/</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;$1&#x27;</span>),\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/www1.example.com/hello&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hello www1&#x27;</span>))\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/www2.example.com/hello&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hello www2&#x27;</span>))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"التوجيه-باستخدام-host-قيمة-الترويسة\">التوجيه باستخدام <code>host</code> قيمة الترويسة</h2>\n<p>يمكن لـ Hono التعامل مع <code>host</code> قيمة الترويسة إذا عيّنت <code>getPath()</code> الدالة في مُنشئ Hono.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>({\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">getPath</span>: <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">req</span>) =&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/&#x27;</span> +\n    req.<span class=\"hljs-property\">headers</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;host&#x27;</span>) +\n    req.<span class=\"hljs-property\">url</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">replace</span>(<span class=\"hljs-regexp\">/^https?:\\/\\/[^/]+(\\/[^?]*).*/</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;$1&#x27;</span>),\n})\n\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/www1.example.com/hello&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hello www1&#x27;</span>))\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// A following request will match the route:</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// new Request(&#x27;http://www1.example.com/hello&#x27;, {</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">//  headers: { host: &#x27;www1.example.com&#x27; },</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// })</span>\n</code></pre>\n<p>من خلال تطبيق هذا، على سبيل المثال، يمكنك تغيير التوجيه عبر <code>User-Agent</code> الترويسة.</p>\n<h2 id=\"أولوية-التوجيه\">أولوية التوجيه</h2>\n<p>تُنفَّذ المعالجات (Handlers) أو الوسيطات (middleware) بترتيب التسجيل.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/book/a&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// a</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/book/:slug&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;common&#x27;</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// common</span>\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code>GET /book/a ---&gt; `a`\nGET /book/b ---&gt; `common`\n</code></pre>\n<p>عند تنفيذ معالج (handler)، ستتوقف العملية.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;common&#x27;</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// common</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/foo&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;foo&#x27;</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// foo</span>\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code>GET /foo ---&gt; `common` // foo will not be dispatched\n</code></pre>\n<p>إذا كان لديك وسيطة تريد تنفيذها، فاكتب الكود أعلى المعالج.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { logger } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono/logger&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">use</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">logger</span>())\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/foo&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;foo&#x27;</span>))\n</code></pre>\n<p>إذا كنت تريد معالج &quot;<em>fallback</em>&quot;، فاكتب الكود أسفل المعالج الآخر.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/bar&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;bar&#x27;</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// bar</span>\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;*&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;fallback&#x27;</span>)) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// fallback</span>\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code>GET /bar ---&gt; `bar`\nGET /foo ---&gt; `fallback`\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"ترتيب-التجميع\">ترتيب التجميع</h2>\n<p>لاحظ أن خطأ تجميع المسارات (routings) يصعب ملاحظته.\nالـ <code>route()</code> تأخذ الدالة التوجيه (routing) المخزَّن من الوسيطة الثانية (مثل <code>three</code> أو <code>two</code>) ويضيفه إلى الخاص به (<code>two</code> أو <code>app</code>) التوجيه.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\">three.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/hi&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hi&#x27;</span>))\ntwo.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">route</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/three&#x27;</span>, three)\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">route</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/two&#x27;</span>, two)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> app\n</code></pre>\n<p>ستُعيد استجابة 200.</p>\n<pre><code>GET /two/three/hi ---&gt; `hi`\n</code></pre>\n<p>ومع ذلك، إذا كانت بترتيب خاطئ، فستُعيد 404.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-ts\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hono&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> app = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> two = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> three = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Hono</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ---cut---</span>\nthree.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/hi&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">c</span>) =&gt;</span> c.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">text</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;hi&#x27;</span>))\napp.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">route</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/two&#x27;</span>, two) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// `two` does not have routes</span>\ntwo.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">route</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/three&#x27;</span>, three)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">default</span> app\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code>GET /two/three/hi ---&gt; 404 Not Found\n</code></pre>\n"}